		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — A concealed mine that detonates when an enemy steps near.</em></p><p><strong>Reaction:</strong> When an enemy enters a space in Range 6. Damage: STRd8 Force on a failed DEX save, half on success. Adjacent enemies take equal damage. Ignores armor.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> The first target is launched back INT spaces on a failed save if they are Large or smaller.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You take half damage from your own explosives.</p><hr><p><em>[M] Gadget activation costs 1 Toolbelt scrap (2 total for the Toolbelt upgrade); the passive is always active. Scrap cost and activation are tracked by the module.</em></p>",
